Add UDAT_REL_UNIT_QUARTER so that inputting "quarter" as option unit of
 Intl.RelativeTimeFormat.format doesn't output blank.
Also backport a newer relUnitFromGeneric and absUnitFromGeneric
 from ICU 71.

https://repo.palemoon.org/MoonchildProductions/UXP/issues/1969

